program	conformance/V68_closure_reference_parameter_is_a_borrow.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	differs
expect	error
build	refused	cannot move out of `e`: it is a closure PARAMETER declared `&var e`, which names storage the CALLER still owns for the length of the call, so the move would release a value its owner still holds
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot move out of `e`: it is a closure PARAMETER declared `&var e`, which names storage the CALLER still owns for the length of the call, so the move would release a value its owner still holds"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/V68_closure_reference_parameter_is_a_borrow.saw:34:35"
log	"     |"
log	" 34 |     v.with_var_ref(0, { &var e in move e })    // error: `e` only borrows"
log	"     |                                   ^"
log	"   hint: to take the value OUT, use the move-out its owner publishes — `swap_out(i, replacement)` on a vector element, `take()` on an `Optional` field — called on the receiver, outside this body"
log	""
log	"error: function `exclusive_face` should return `Owned` but returns `Void`"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/V68_closure_reference_parameter_is_a_borrow.saw:31:1"
log	"     |"
log	" 31 | func exclusive_face() -> Owned {"
log	"     | ^"
log	""
log	"error: cannot move out of `e`: it is a closure PARAMETER declared `&e`, which names storage the CALLER still owns for the length of the call, so the move would release a value its owner still holds"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/V68_closure_reference_parameter_is_a_borrow.saw:40:27"
log	"     |"
log	" 40 |     v.with_ref(0, { &e in move e })            // error: theft through a `&`"
log	"     |                           ^"
log	"   hint: to take the value OUT, use the move-out its owner publishes — `swap_out(i, replacement)` on a vector element, `take()` on an `Optional` field — called on the receiver, outside this body"
log	""
